class_name RoomTemplates
extends RefCounted
## Room layouts. START, TREASURE, BOSS and a few COMBAT rooms are hand-made text below;
## most combat and exit rooms are generated by generate(), in several sizes, with the
## floor's hazards (FloorData pit_chance / spike_chance / lava_chance / big_room_chance).
##
##   .  floor      #  wall       R  rock       P  pillar      C  crate
##   O  pit (blocks walking, not bullets)      ^  spikes (hurt while raised)
##   ~  lava (hurts, dash over it)             S  enemy spawn point
##
## Hand-made layouts: exactly 14 rows of exactly 28 characters (the interior of a 30 x 16 room).
## Keep the door lanes clear: the middle 4 columns in the first/last 4 rows,
## and the middle 4 rows in the first/last 4 columns.

## Interior sizes (the room adds a 1-tile wall all round). Keep both numbers even.
